# .gitignore for a .NET solution
# Generated for Visual Studio, .NET CLI, and common editors

## Build artifacts
bin/
obj/
artifacts/
publish/

## Visual Studio
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## Rider
.idea/

## VS Code
.vscode/

## NuGet
*.nupkg
.nuget/
packages/

## Logs and databases
*.log
logs/
TestResults/
*.trx
*.db
*.sqlite

## macOS
.DS_Store

## Node/npm
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

## ASP.NET / Blazor
wwwroot/lib/
scopedcss/
obj/**/staticwebassets*

## User secrets and local config
secrets.json
appsettings.Development.json

## EF Core scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadme.txt

## Coverage / IDE extras
coverage/
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

# Ignore publish output
/PublishOutput/

# Keep generated files out
*.generated.cs

# End of file
